// Contains the microcomputer code and Boot 0 microcodepnew 15/T doradobaserom.mb/f $ABSOLUTE/m 0/c 0/b ^170000R8/a 0/s 174000R8/a 0/s// Contains the Boot 1 microcode//  there are now three proms of dorado initialization code//  C000, C800, D000// (by Frank Vest and Willie-Sue, 3 Sept 85)pnew 15/T doradobaserom.mb/f $ABSOLUTE/m 0/c 0/b ^140000R8/a 0/s 144000R8/a 0/s 150000R8/a 0/s